			OSQL
	      ORACLE Visual SQL Query Tool

---------------------------------------------------------------
		   PL/SQL Menu Bar
---------------------------------------------------------------

The following menu buttons and associated menu items are
available on the PL/SQL menu bar:

%%hyperhelp_mark File%%
----------
  File
----------

  Load SQL...		Load a file into the PL/SQL statement
			text entry area using a file selector
			widget.

  Save			Save the text in the PL/SQL statement text
  			entry area in to the current save file
  			as indicated.
			
  Save SQL As...		Save into a file the text in the PL/SQL
  			statement text entry area using a file
  			selector widget.

  Close Window		Close this instance of the PL/SQL tool.

%%hyperhelp_mark Help%%
----------
  Help
----------

  Osql...			Display help on how to use osql.

  PL/SQL...		Display help on how to use the PL/SQL tool.
